{"event": "model_response", "time": 1792045194.1070251, "response": {"id": "e9ae6021-88d6-4aaa-8182-dc3f063ba220", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1792045191, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"test_string_utils.py\"}", "reasoning_content": "Let me analyze the tests carefully.\n\n`test_both_sides_and_balance`: for the string \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\" (26 chars).\n\nHead length = (max_len - 3 + 1)//2.\n\nFor limit=5: head = (5-3+1)//2 = 3//2 = 1. tail = max_len - 3 - head = 5-3-1 = 1. Result: \"a\" + \"...\" + \"z\" = \"a...z\". Correct.\n\nlimit=6: head = (6-3+1)//2 = 4//2 = 2. tail = 6-3-2 = 1. \"ab...z\". Correct.\n\nlimit=7: head = (7-3+1)//2 = 5//2 = 2. tail = 7-3-2 = 2. \"ab...yz\". Correct.\n\nlimit=8: head = (8-3+1)//2 = 6//2 = 3. tail = 8-3-3=2. \"abc...yz\". Correct.\n\nlimit=11: head=(11-3+1)//2=9//2=4. tail=11-3-4=4. \"abcd...wxyz\". Correct.\n\nSo formula given in prompt works. Now unicode truncation: \"甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸\" (10 chars), max_len=6. head=(6-3+1)//2=2. tail=6-3-2=1. s[:2]=\"甲乙\", s[-1:]=\"癸\" => \"甲乙...癸\". Correct.\n\nNow implement. Also validation order: max_len < 5 raises ValueError regardless.\n\nFor s=\"abcdef\", max_len=6: len==6 <= 6, return s. Good.\n\nLet me write."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 3153, "completion_tokens": 412, "total_tokens": 3565, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 768}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 398}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 768, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 2385}, "system_fingerprint": "aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}}
